# ──────────────────────────────────────────────
# Dependencies
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────
# node_modules is the folder npm fills with downloaded library code.
# It's huge (often hundreds of MB) and can always be rebuilt by running
# `npm install`, which reads package.json and re-downloads everything.
# Never commit it.
node_modules/
**/node_modules/

# ──────────────────────────────────────────────
# Environment & secrets
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────
# .env files contain secrets: database passwords, JWT signing keys,
# API tokens. They MUST never reach GitHub. We commit a .env.example
# file (with fake values) so other developers know what variables to set,
# but the real .env stays local-only.
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
**/.env
**/.env.local

# ──────────────────────────────────────────────
# Build output
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────
# When we compile TypeScript to JavaScript, or bundle React for production,
# the output goes into folders like dist/ or build/. These are generated
# artifacts — they can always be regenerated from source code, so we don't
# track them.
dist/
build/
**/dist/
**/build/

# ──────────────────────────────────────────────
# Logs
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────
# Log files are runtime output, not source code. They grow unbounded
# and would pollute the repo.

*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
logs/

# ──────────────────────────────────────────────
# Editor & OS files
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────
# VS Code stores per-folder settings in .vscode/. Some teams commit this
# (to share settings), others don't. We'll keep it personal for now.
.vscode/
.idea/

# Windows generates these "thumbnail cache" and metadata files automatically.
# Nobody wants them in their repo.
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini

# macOS generates these too — included so anyone on a Mac contributing
# to your project doesn't accidentally commit them.
.DS_Store

# ──────────────────────────────────────────────
# TypeScript
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────
# TypeScript's incremental build cache file.
*.tsbuildinfo

# ──────────────────────────────────────────────
# Testing
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────
# Coverage reports are generated; they don't belong in source control.
coverage/
.nyc_output/